	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The early morning sun casts its refreshing rays into the still air of the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The freshly-scrubbed floorboards practically glisten with its light.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whew, nice and clean.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Hotori casts a satisfied look around the spotless dojo.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"We spent all morning cleaning instead of training.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"But because of how big the dojo is, it still ended up being quite the workout.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Our plan was to head straight to school afterwards, so\nwe're already dressed in our uniforms.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How about some breakfast?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds good.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Hotori takes a wrapped parcel out of her bag.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Since deepening our relationship, eating breakfast together like this has become part of our daily morning routine.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Here you go, eat up now.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Hotori unwraps a light but balanced meal of salted rice balls, rolled omelettes, and fresh pickled vegetables.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mmm, maybe I should have put a bit more effort into\ntoday's...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No way. This is more than enough.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Really? I'll take your word for it.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Hotori leaves it at that, showing me a relieved smile.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Here you go.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"She picks up a piece of omelette with her chopsticks and holds it out to me.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I stare hesitantly, unsure what she's playing at.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? Uh, umm...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Say 'aah' for me?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"She bashfully whispers, a slight blush on her face.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mmh...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"She's not the only one who's embarrassed here...",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"But it's just the two of us here in the dojo, so there's no need to worry about being seen by anyone else.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"She leaves me with only one choice.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"I lean over and eat the omelette in a single bite.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"The refreshing crunch of the scallions balances perfectly together with the sweetness of the egg, lending the simple dish an exquisite taste and texture.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...How is it?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Great! Next up...”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Hotori begins prowling the lunchbox for her next target.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Time out. We're still doing this?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No time outs.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then I forfeit.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No forfeiting, either.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Here. Say 'aah.'”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"She holds out a bite of stewed beef this time.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"She's totally seized the initiative with her overwhelming offensive, leaving me with no room for a counterattack.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"I resign myself and open wide.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...How is it?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Every bite fills my palate with the sublime salty-sweet flavor of the beef.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Unable to stop myself, I immediately follow up with a big bite of my rice ball.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It makes me wish I could eat this every single day.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“E-Every day...!? That makes it sound like you're proposing to me...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Hotori fidgets restlessly, a deep blush spreading across her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, I didn't mean it that way.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ooh... That doesn't make me any happier...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Hotori murmurs in a deflated voice.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, we're gonna need to save the Empire first before we can get married.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“M-Married?!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"The blush rushes back into her cheeks in an instant.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Anyone who's only seen Hotori's usual self could never imagine she could act like this...)”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Thinking idle thoughts like these, I continue moving my chopsticks.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"After our meal, we sit side by side, slowly enjoying the tea she poured from her thermos.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Hotori lets out a contented sigh after taking a sip.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, how's it going with Natsumi?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hear you've got a new song coming out.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah. The dance is tricky, so I'm having trouble getting it down.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't push yourself too hard.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But I have to give it my all.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Her words positively drip with her resolve.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Hotori spares absolutely no effort, both as chairman of the Blades and as Natsumi.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Natsumi's popularity is as high as ever, and she's gaining more and more ≪fans≫ by the day.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"It's no wonder that lately, Hotori has seemed a little worn out.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you getting enough rest?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm fine.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You say that, but weren't you dozing off in class the other day?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-You noticed that?!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Hotori looks down dejectedly.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not trying to get on your case about it.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I just feel guilty that you're the only one who has it so hard.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Chairman of the Blades and the most popular singer in the country.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"She's gladly doing it all for the sake of our ambitions, but\nthere's no way it's not taking a heavy toll on her.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"The fact that I can't do anything to ease her burden makes it all the more vexing.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maybe you should take a break from making food for us every day...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Hotori has to wake herself up extra early in the mornings to prepare our breakfast.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I can't bear the thought that she's cutting down on her already limited sleep just for my sake.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"But Hotori stubbornly shakes her head at my suggestion.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No waaay.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Hotori sulkily hugs her legs like a headstrong child.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't wanna have to compromise on anything I do. Not as chairman of the Sworn Blades, not as Natsumi... and especially not as your lover.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's not like anything will change if you just stop making breakfast.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll lose my precious breakfast time with you.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Hotori murmurs with a big pout on her face.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm scared that if I keep sacrificing my time with you, we\nwon't have any time left to spend together.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course I know how important it is to work towards the\nEmpire's restoration.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But the only thing that motivates me to give my all every day... is being together like this with you.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Hotori bashfully buries her face in her lap to hide the expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I stare at the empty lunchbox sitting between us.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Hotori would rather give up everything else than spend any less time with me.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Honestly, I feel the exact same way.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Even so, I want her to get as much rest as she can.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Which means that I also have to do everything I can.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll start making our breakfast from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Hotori suddenly raises her head.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This way, you'll have more time to rest, and we can still have breakfast together.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“C-Can you even cook?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll master it with enough practice.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I confidently assert with absolutely no proof whatsoever.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"What I said must have been somehow funny, as Hotori bursts out in a giggle.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've never seen you cook even once before.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm already scared to taste it.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Looks like she's approved of my idea.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Still sitting, Hotori scooches over until she's right in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Her moist, slightly feverish eyes peer right into my own.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Right now, I'm sure my eyes must be filled with just as much desire as hers.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey... Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Would you... kiss me?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Hotori wantonly whispers into my ear.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"I want to connect our lips just as badly as she does.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Now that our hearts are as one, it's only natural that we'd want to become one with our bodies as well.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nnh...”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"I gently place my lips over hers.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Hotori wastes no time in wrapping her arms around my back.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"This is bad news. I can feel it.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"My self-control is rapidly slipping away with each passing second.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I want her. Right here and now.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I wrap my own arms around her slender body and squeeze her tight.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“S-Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're gonna be late for school...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Despite her words, Hotori makes no effort to shake me off.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. I don't think I can hold back.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, what am I gonna do with you?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In that case, can I take the lead today?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're always making me feel so good...”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Hotori turns her bright red cheeks to the side immediately after slipping off her school uniform.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“D-Don't stare so much.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's embarrassing...”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"So she says, but how can she possibly expect me to pull my eyes away from her beautiful body?",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"The fact that she's still so innocent, even after all this time, is simply adorable.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Hotori's energy being completely spent, she collapses like a marionette with its strings cut.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Fwaah... haaah...”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I wrap my arms tightly around her, supporting her weight.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Hotori smiles a contented, dreamy smile at me.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't feel... my anything...”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"“Do you want me to fix that?” I plead with my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“D-Don't make me say it...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"She tries her best to give me an angry glare, but she only manages to keep it up for a few moments.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But, yeah... Let's go another round...”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Hotori whispers with a sultry voice.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"There's no possible way I could resist such a temptation.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about school?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine to miss just one day... right?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
